<title>USA: Dade County, Fla., repriced, top yld unchanged.</title>
<headline>Dade County, Fla., repriced, top yld unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co., Inc. said on Tuesday it repriced and restructured its Dade County, Fla., $131 million Aviation revenue refunding bond deal, adjusting the yields and par amounts in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing/restructure follows:  </p>
<p>DADE COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $130,350,000*</p>
<p>AVIATION REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>MIAMI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT</p>
<p>(HUB OF THE AMERICAS)</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE CHANGE IN COUPONS AND CHANGE IN PRICE FOR 1998 AND</p>
<p>2008 MATURITIES.</p>
<p>WE WILL TAKE ORDERS IN 1998 UNTIL 2:00 P.M., E.D.S.T., TODAY, TUESDAY,</p>
<p>MAY 6, 1997.</p>
<p>				SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa - FSA     S&amp;P: AAA - FSA	     FITCH: NR</p>
<p>AA3 UNDERLYING	   A UNDERLYING		 AA- UNDERLYING</p>
<p>DATED: 06/01/1997	FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1998		2,240M    4.60  %	  4.20</p>
<p>10/01/1999		4,800M    4.60  %	  4.60</p>
<p>10/01/2000		5,100M    5.25  %	  4.85</p>
<p>10/01/2001		5,415M    5.25  %	  4.95</p>
<p>10/01/2002		5,750M    5.50  %	  5.05</p>
<p>10/01/2003	     32,550M    5.75  %	  5.10</p>
<p>10/01/2004	     34,450M    5.75  %	  5.20</p>
<p>10/01/2005	     10,950M    5.75  %	  5.25</p>
<p>10/01/2008		9,160M    6.00  %	  5.35</p>
<p>10/01/2009		9,705M    5.375 %	  5.50</p>
<p>10/01/2010	     10,230M    5.375 %	  5.60</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/01/2007    101.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 10/01/2009</p>
<p>10/01/2008:    NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, May 7, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on July 8, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
